The hook-bypass fence is adapted from rat-stack
(https://github.com/joelhooks/rat-stack, commit 1f9545b6a51337279f73759321fbc64ed4135526):

- scripts/vcs-command-policy.mjs
- scripts/hooks/block-git-no-verify.mjs
- .pi/extensions/git-interceptor.ts
- .agents/settings.json (from .claude/settings.json)
- scripts/acceptance-cold-clone.sh
- lefthook.yml

The Effect setup is adapted from the same rat-stack commit:

- tsconfig.base.json (compiler flags and Effect diagnostic list, from tsconfig.base.json)
- package.json `prepare` script (from package.json)
- examples/booking-platform/apps/api/vitest.config.ts and examples/booking-platform/packages/bookings/vitest.config.ts (from packages/core/vitest.config.ts)
- scripts/vendor-agent-sources.sh (from scripts/vendor-agent-sources.sh)
- skills/add-an-effect-module/SKILL.md (from skills/add-a-capability/SKILL.md)
- examples/booking-platform/packages/bookings/src and examples/booking-platform/apps/api/src (service and test shape from packages/core/src and packages/core/test)

The pnpm workspace and Turborepo setup is adapted from the same rat-stack commit:

- pnpm-workspace.yaml (workspace folders, allowBuilds, and minimumReleaseAgeExclude, from pnpm-workspace.yaml)
- turbo.json (typecheck and test tasks, from turbo.json)
- examples/booking-platform/apps/api/package.json, examples/booking-platform/apps/api/tsconfig.json, examples/booking-platform/packages/bookings/package.json, and examples/booking-platform/packages/bookings/tsconfig.json (per-package scripts and tsconfig shape, from packages/core)
- .github/workflows/ci.yml (corepack pnpm setup and frozen-lockfile install, from .github/workflows/ci.yml)

